Package: gxde-input-engine
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: GXDE Native Wayland Input Engine
 Native input engine for GXDE OS, works with gxde-wlcom / FlakeWM / Treeland.
 Built-in simple pinyin engine, follow zwp-text-input-v3 protocol.